WEBVTT

00:21.896 --> 00:25.442
<i>Divine Materialization-class sorcery:
Luxa.</i>

00:31.781 --> 00:35.452
To think I'd be forced to bestow divine
sorcery on these kinds of fools.

00:35.869 --> 00:37.287
Can't say I like that.

00:37.495 --> 00:42.249
My research into divine magic will proceed
more efficiently with multiple hands.

00:42.250 --> 00:45.795
Go ahead and create a path for them so
that they don't need to perform a ritual.

00:46.504 --> 00:48.797
I might have made an exception
for you, Prince Lloyd,

00:48.798 --> 00:51.176
but I've only done that for one
other person in the history of-

00:53.428 --> 00:55.555
Can't you shrink down more like Grim?

00:56.181 --> 01:00.392
You'd ask me to take on this horrible,
gremlin-like form, Prince Lloyd?!

01:00.393 --> 01:02.811
Yeah, you heard him. Get a move on.

01:02.812 --> 01:07.232
Or what, you mean to tell me you
can't handle basic metamorphosis?

01:07.233 --> 01:08.317
Is it because you're a dumbass?

01:08.318 --> 01:10.070
How dare you, you imbecilic infernal?!

01:10.653 --> 01:14.449
Behold, the divine grace with
which an angel transforms!

01:16.451 --> 01:18.452
What do you think, Prince Lloyd?

01:18.453 --> 01:21.205
Overwhelmed with the urge
to embrace me, aren't you?

01:21.206 --> 01:23.291
Here you are, Lloyd.

01:25.043 --> 01:26.419
He's not even looking.

01:37.013 --> 01:41.893
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

03:00.054 --> 03:04.850
So, that whole thing with Escher's
recital was divine sorcery too, right?

03:04.851 --> 03:07.978
It was. Purification-class divine sorcery.

03:07.979 --> 03:12.984
It heals wounds, as well as exorcising
the undead, ethereals, and demons.

03:13.276 --> 03:14.402
<i>The undead...</i>

03:17.155 --> 03:19.406
We're back, boss.

03:19.407 --> 03:22.243
Feels like I had a bad dream...

03:23.870 --> 03:26.622
You're that pain in the
ass kid from the church!

03:26.623 --> 03:29.375
You two are from Lordost, huh?

03:30.376 --> 03:32.795
You're really in for it,
now that we've found you!

03:36.507 --> 03:37.633
Boss?!

03:37.634 --> 03:39.510
I'm not clear on the specifics,

03:39.761 --> 03:42.679
but I'm hoping one finger
will be enough to make up for it.

03:42.680 --> 03:44.139
Whoa, whoa, none of that, now.

03:44.140 --> 03:46.642
Sorry about them, Lloyd.

03:46.643 --> 03:49.519
The people of Lordost are pretty rowdy.

03:49.520 --> 03:52.397
Luckily, the hierarchy around
here is decided by who's strongest,

03:52.398 --> 03:54.066
which saves us a lot of trouble.

03:54.067 --> 03:58.403
Boss Lady Talia and Boss Crow, why are
you being so nice to this shrimp?!

03:58.404 --> 04:01.031
If they're not gonna do
anything, then we will!

04:01.032 --> 04:03.534
Say your prayers, you stupid runt!

04:03.868 --> 04:05.078
Glow!

04:07.830 --> 04:10.708
We're really sorry about what happened!

04:12.585 --> 04:15.212
Is it me or does that one completely
undo their personality?!

04:15.213 --> 04:19.299
It's normally not this effective.
But Prince Lloyd's in a class to his own.

04:19.300 --> 04:22.344
We know what we did wasn't cool.

04:22.345 --> 04:24.722
We'll go apologize
to the sister right now.

04:25.181 --> 04:28.558
What's this about apologizing to a sister?

04:28.559 --> 04:33.690
Oh, these two tried to pull some
stuff on Escher and Princess Saria.

04:36.067 --> 04:39.236
They did <i>what</i> to Escher and Saria?!

04:39.237 --> 04:41.029
There was groping and stuff, too.

04:41.030 --> 04:43.574
Gro-gro-groping?!

04:43.866 --> 04:47.203
You wretches! It's divine
punishment time, the lethal kind!

04:47.328 --> 04:51.832
Wait, Ren and Babylon didn't
recognize these guys at all.

04:51.833 --> 04:54.251
Ren's been living in the castle,
so she wouldn't know them,

04:54.252 --> 04:57.170
and Babylon keeps to himself regarding
the citizens of the island.

04:57.171 --> 04:59.589
Where is he, anyway?

04:59.590 --> 05:02.719
Cleaning up after Prince Lloyd's mess...

05:03.469 --> 05:05.305
Delicious!

05:06.139 --> 05:09.016
Come now! Have some table manners!

05:09.017 --> 05:11.059
It really does taste amazing!

05:11.060 --> 05:13.980
I'm glad you decided to stay behind.

05:15.315 --> 05:18.818
<i>Considering the Prince
ran off after one day...</i>

05:23.364 --> 05:25.992
Now you'll be able to
use divine sorcery too.

05:26.326 --> 05:28.911
Take care of things around here, Babylon.

05:33.207 --> 05:36.043
Oh, Prince Lloyd. Welcome home.

05:36.044 --> 05:38.420
Prince Lloyd, why don't
you join me in the bath?

05:38.421 --> 05:41.173
Prince Lloyd, you should
sleep with me tonight!

05:41.174 --> 05:45.636
I-I-I had no idea you were
so popular, Prince Lloyd!

05:45.887 --> 05:50.390
This is the life a prince?!
The <i>seventh</i> prince?! It's paradise!

05:50.391 --> 05:52.517
I made the right move sticking with you!

05:52.518 --> 05:53.352
Booyah!

05:54.854 --> 05:57.690
If you wanna live here,
settle your bird butt down.

05:58.900 --> 06:00.526
I could go for some tea.

06:01.903 --> 06:03.528
There are <i>two</i> Prince Lloyds?!

06:03.529 --> 06:06.782
Oh, that's the wooden doll
Prince Lloyd made of himself.

06:06.783 --> 06:09.410
It can handle simple stuff automatically.

06:12.955 --> 06:14.664
I see, I see.

06:14.665 --> 06:18.920
So, you're a doll.
All hollow on the inside, huh...

06:19.587 --> 06:20.879
Hey, you chump cherub!

06:20.880 --> 06:24.383
I'm fond of this little guy, so if
you don't wanna die, hands off!

06:25.843 --> 06:27.511
Ghoul hunting?

06:27.512 --> 06:32.809
Yep. Undead ghouls are the perfect subject
if we want to test divine sorcery.

06:33.226 --> 06:36.311
Are there really
that many ghouls out there?

06:36.312 --> 06:39.482
I actually picked up some intel
during our trip to Lordost that...

06:41.609 --> 06:42.568
Come in!

06:45.947 --> 06:47.614
You called for me?

06:47.615 --> 06:52.161
Yeah! If you've got nothing to do,
how about joining me for a ghoul hunt?

06:59.085 --> 07:01.379
What a babe! I like her.

07:04.549 --> 07:05.925
I'm free!

07:09.137 --> 07:12.014
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

07:14.684 --> 07:18.353
This bridge is huge!
And there're so many people!

07:18.354 --> 07:23.234
It's the Great Daen Bridge, the linchpin
of east-to-westbound traffic in the city.

07:23.568 --> 07:26.237
Still, it's kind of hard to believe

07:26.821 --> 07:32.284
that ghouls are lurking in such
a thriving part of town...

07:32.285 --> 07:37.497
That adventurer's guild has received
the most sightings in this area.

07:37.498 --> 07:40.460
You can't track down their lair
from scent?

07:41.294 --> 07:44.254
Given that they smell like rotting flesh,

07:44.255 --> 07:47.883
in a populated area, the scent is
hard to distinguish from food waste.

07:47.884 --> 07:52.471
<i>And my Spectral Detection won't be of
much use considering how crowded it is.</i>

07:52.472 --> 07:54.515
Lloyd!

07:55.016 --> 07:57.893
Escher? And Saria.

07:57.894 --> 08:02.063
Without a bodyguard, again.
What brings you into town, today?

08:02.064 --> 08:05.233
We decided to have some
delicious pancakes for lunch.

08:05.234 --> 08:06.526
Would you like to join us?

08:06.527 --> 08:09.404
Prince Lloyd! Let's go! We should go!

08:09.405 --> 08:10.907
We got stuff to do, dammit.

08:11.866 --> 08:13.034
Lloyd?

08:13.409 --> 08:15.870
Pancaaakes!

08:23.503 --> 08:25.295
This is a shocker.

08:25.296 --> 08:27.005
It's the first time I've seen you

08:27.006 --> 08:28.924
as excited for something as you
are with magic, Prince Lloyd.

08:28.925 --> 08:32.428
Grim, pancakes <i>are</i> magic.

08:33.971 --> 08:37.057
Their fluffy bodies filled with
an air of savory goodness...

08:37.058 --> 08:40.852
Add a topping of honey syrup and
rich butter that synchronize,

08:40.853 --> 08:44.773
with the resulting aroma that arises causing an
involuntary flexing at the corners of the mouth,

08:44.774 --> 08:46.942
overstimulating the salivary glands...

08:46.943 --> 08:49.402
If that's not magic, then what is?

08:49.403 --> 08:50.696
You're right!

08:51.072 --> 08:53.990
Lloyd, if this is your first time
eating the pancakes here,

08:53.991 --> 08:55.867
start by having them plain.

08:55.868 --> 08:58.286
You need to yada yada yada
the foundational flavor.

08:58.287 --> 08:59.996
That goes without saying,
my good sister Saria!

08:59.997 --> 09:03.250
The toppings are yada yada
yada for the pancake itself.

09:03.251 --> 09:06.045
<i>They even like the same foods...</i>

09:06.837 --> 09:08.548
Here you are.

09:09.298 --> 09:14.719
What even is this?! The way it fluffs
up inside your mouth before melting...

09:14.720 --> 09:18.431
Sylpha, do you think we could
start serving this at the castle?

09:18.432 --> 09:21.685
Of course! I promise to
replicate the recipe.

09:21.686 --> 09:25.272
Come to think of it, you never mentioned
what you all were doing in town today.

09:25.273 --> 09:26.482
Oh, well...

09:27.608 --> 09:29.277
We're hunting ghouls.

09:30.736 --> 09:32.821
Have you heard anything, Escher?

09:32.822 --> 09:37.909
There've been a lot of people taking refuge
at the church after being attacked by ghouls.

09:37.910 --> 09:40.453
Most sightings have centered
around the Great Daen Bridge

09:40.454 --> 09:43.499
the large northern cemetery,
and the alleys to the south.

09:43.874 --> 09:48.712
Some of the adventurers dispatched to
deal with it have gone missing, as well.

09:48.713 --> 09:50.756
Missing adventurers?

09:54.844 --> 09:56.095
As for me...

09:56.804 --> 10:00.266
All I care about is the
recital not being canceled.

10:00.558 --> 10:03.059
Are you going to put on another one?!

10:03.060 --> 10:05.771
This time it's going to be even better!

10:06.063 --> 10:09.983
It's on the day that celebrates the birth
of God-the Great Advent Festival.

10:09.984 --> 10:13.279
Both the King and the Pope
will be in attendance!

10:13.738 --> 10:16.032
I'd love it if you all could join us.

10:17.074 --> 10:20.077
If it's able to be held, that is...

10:25.166 --> 10:29.377
Okay! We're gonna get rid of those ghouls!

10:29.378 --> 10:31.339
Someone sounds motivated.

10:35.343 --> 10:40.388
Songs that everyone loves...
Delicious pancake shops...

10:40.389 --> 10:43.726
After seeing so much that I
didn't know about before...

10:44.352 --> 10:49.732
I love this country, and I
don't want anyone to hurt it!

10:51.984 --> 10:56.363
Well, regarding the ghoul den, we've got
our targets narrowed down quite a bit.

10:56.364 --> 11:00.283
The Great Daen Bridge seems to be
the place with the most sightings.

11:00.284 --> 11:05.206
But I really can't picture a den
of ghouls in such a place.

11:08.709 --> 11:09.877
Don't look up...

11:10.670 --> 11:11.921
But down!

11:14.632 --> 11:17.801
Beneath the bridge, at the
entrance to the sewers.

11:17.802 --> 11:20.178
Well, it seems obvious,
now that we're here.

11:20.179 --> 11:21.639
How's the scent?

11:24.225 --> 11:27.686
Impossible to tell. It feels like
my nose is going to fall off.

11:28.062 --> 11:31.689
There's definitely something
rotten in there, though.

11:31.690 --> 11:36.152
We'll just have to go and check. I'm kind
of worried about something I heard.

11:36.153 --> 11:39.948
Regarding the missing adventurers?

11:39.949 --> 11:41.700
Is it someone you know?

11:42.076 --> 11:45.620
Well, the reason I knew about these ghouls

11:45.621 --> 11:48.457
is because she attended our party...

11:48.874 --> 11:52.752
She's likely gone ahead of us,
as part of a job, so I'm worried.

11:52.753 --> 11:54.170
Don't tell me...

11:54.171 --> 11:56.506
if it was someone so presumptuous

11:56.507 --> 11:58.926
as to invite the prince of a nation
on a ghoul hunt, then-

11:59.552 --> 12:01.261
Lloyd!

12:01.262 --> 12:04.056
Tao! You're okay.

12:05.683 --> 12:08.476
Were you worried about me?

12:08.477 --> 12:11.563
You're a little sweetheart, huh, Lloyd?!

12:11.564 --> 12:14.816
You really wanted to see
me that bad?! Oh, you!

12:14.817 --> 12:16.234
Sylpha...

12:16.235 --> 12:17.236
Chop.

12:18.779 --> 12:23.908
Prince Lloyd has taken on this ghoul hunt
in order to test his divine sorcery.

12:23.909 --> 12:25.535
You are simply an extra.

12:25.536 --> 12:26.370
An extra?!

12:26.537 --> 12:31.624
So, Tao, seeing as you came out of the
sewers, is that where the ghoul den is?

12:31.625 --> 12:34.878
That's what I thought,
but I couldn't find anything.

12:34.879 --> 12:37.714
It's filthy, and stinky, and I got lost...

12:37.715 --> 12:42.761
It took sensing your presence to
find my way out of that maze.

12:43.262 --> 12:46.932
Not a great environment for being
able to focus on channeling qi.

12:48.225 --> 12:50.310
I'm gonna head back to my lodgings.

12:50.311 --> 12:53.314
I dropped a bunch of stuff,
like my torch...

12:53.814 --> 12:55.941
No. That won't be a problem.

12:56.734 --> 13:01.113
Divine Purification-class sorcery: Helios!

13:03.073 --> 13:06.784
Hey, you're right!
No need for a torch, now.

13:06.785 --> 13:11.248
And because Helios is purifying,
there's even more to it.

13:14.126 --> 13:17.254
All the dirt...
and my exhaustion's gone, too!

13:17.880 --> 13:21.633
Sewer water that's as clean
as a pristine forest stream?!

13:21.634 --> 13:23.718
Not just that!

13:23.719 --> 13:28.641
The air is as clear as a wind-swept plain!

13:29.683 --> 13:32.645
This light is kinda rough on me...

13:35.773 --> 13:40.652
With enough clean air, I can fill
my lungs and really channel qi!

13:40.653 --> 13:43.155
Qi Technique: Spectral Detection!

13:50.538 --> 13:53.207
Thanks for the change of clothes, Ren!

13:53.541 --> 13:56.126
It's a little tight up top, but...

13:57.044 --> 13:59.879
So, where is the ghoul den?

13:59.880 --> 14:03.050
This whole area seems suspicious.

14:03.842 --> 14:07.179
You're gonna drive out the ghouls?

14:07.846 --> 14:09.722
Be careful out there, Shiro.

14:09.723 --> 14:13.227
And once you step outside Prince
Lloyd's Helios spell...

14:14.979 --> 14:16.772
it'll smell really bad.

14:22.111 --> 14:25.154
With this kind of stench, Shiro's sense
of smell will be overwhelmed.

14:25.155 --> 14:26.990
This might take a while.

14:26.991 --> 14:29.785
<i>I guess I'll use Spectral Detection
to scan the area too.</i>

14:31.579 --> 14:34.122
I caught you red-handed this time, Lloyd!

14:34.123 --> 14:35.957
That was qi breathing, wasn't it?

14:35.958 --> 14:36.958
<i>Crap...</i>

14:36.959 --> 14:39.752
Now, where did you learn that, I wonder?

14:39.753 --> 14:41.045
Sylpha?

14:41.046 --> 14:41.881
Pow.

14:43.549 --> 14:46.843
By the way, did you not
bring Demonbane with you?

14:46.844 --> 14:49.597
No. I'd rather keep it clean.

14:49.847 --> 14:52.182
And seeing how you asked
me to accompany you...

14:52.766 --> 14:55.895
I'm sure there's something
else you'd like me to wield.

14:59.857 --> 15:03.860
I'm thinking this might be
the perfect opportunity.

15:03.861 --> 15:05.612
For what, exactly?

15:05.613 --> 15:09.282
For us to see who's stronger.

15:09.283 --> 15:11.492
How about we settle it with a little game?

15:11.493 --> 15:12.995
Asinine.

15:13.287 --> 15:18.833
As I previously stated, this mission is
for Prince Lloyd to test divine sorcery.

15:18.834 --> 15:20.168
We won't have time for that kind of-

15:20.169 --> 15:23.005
Let me think. The winner gets a prize...

15:23.464 --> 15:26.634
And that's a one-on-one,
all-day date, with Lloyd!

15:27.760 --> 15:31.012
Whoa, Tao, what are you talking about?

15:31.013 --> 15:33.222
Hey, if we're helping
with your experiment,

15:33.223 --> 15:35.935
the least we could expect
is some reward, right?

15:37.728 --> 15:41.272
Limit your insanity to the
idea of challenging me, girl.

15:41.273 --> 15:43.524
H-Hey, I've got my own reasons!

15:43.525 --> 15:46.527
So, what do you say? You in, or not?

15:46.528 --> 15:51.283
I-I think I'll give it a try... perhaps.

15:52.326 --> 15:54.286
The rules are super simple!

15:56.080 --> 15:59.541
Whoever kills the most ghouls, wins!

16:01.001 --> 16:03.628
Even a stupid maid could understand that!

16:03.629 --> 16:06.715
I hope you realize I could, in my
stupidity, accidentally kill you.

16:13.430 --> 16:17.433
They're Luxa. Take them for a spin,
and let me know what you think.

16:17.434 --> 16:19.143
Everybody understand?

16:19.144 --> 16:22.689
Whoever takes out the most ghouls
gets that date with Lloyd!

16:22.690 --> 16:26.985
Absolutely ridiculous. Why even
humor this farcical idea?

16:26.986 --> 16:29.947
I-I know, right?
Going on a date would be so presumptuous.

16:31.073 --> 16:32.073
Then...

16:32.074 --> 16:34.076
(Win a Date With Lloyd
Contest Begins)

16:41.834 --> 16:43.085
Off I go.

16:46.380 --> 16:47.964
(Tao +1
Total Kills: 3)

16:47.965 --> 16:48.966
(Tao +1
Total Kills: 4)

16:53.178 --> 16:54.846
Keep 'em coming, now!

16:54.847 --> 16:57.850
Here's number five and six!

16:58.892 --> 17:03.896
House of Langlis
Flowing Good Girl, Good Girl.

17:03.897 --> 17:06.150
Good, good girl.

17:07.401 --> 17:08.235
Got 'em!

17:08.819 --> 17:11.238
What do you mean, "got 'em?!"

17:12.156 --> 17:14.073
Oh, I'm sorry.

17:14.074 --> 17:16.744
Were you doing something?

17:17.161 --> 17:18.287
You little-

17:22.750 --> 17:24.876
Come on, quit following me!

17:24.877 --> 17:28.797
No, no, I'm just testing to see
how sharp this Luxal weapon is.

17:29.048 --> 17:31.132
Now, would you kindly get out of the way?

17:31.133 --> 17:32.592
Where do you get off?!

17:32.593 --> 17:35.721
As a matter of fact,
haven't you only been kicking?!

17:36.221 --> 17:37.681
(Tao +1
Total Kills: 7)

17:38.015 --> 17:40.516
Use those gauntlets Prince Lloyd made!

17:40.517 --> 17:42.393
Don't you know what this
experiment is about?!

17:42.394 --> 17:44.479
The seven you took down
shouldn't even count!

17:44.480 --> 17:48.691
Well, look who was counting all along,
you degenerate domestic!

17:48.692 --> 17:51.403
If you wanna be like that...

18:09.213 --> 18:12.174
<i>She managed to take four of
the five I was aiming at!</i>

18:12.382 --> 18:15.009
<i>Sylpha really is scary-good!</i>

18:15.010 --> 18:19.055
<i>She's not using qi or sorcery,
but her every move is freakishly good!</i>

18:19.056 --> 18:24.310
<i>Tao... for you to damage my weapon,
even if it's one that I'm unaccustomed to...</i>

18:24.311 --> 18:26.062
<i>You've grown stronger.</i>

18:26.063 --> 18:29.774
Lloyd! This Luxa thing
doesn't do enough damage!

18:29.775 --> 18:31.067
I want a new one!

18:31.068 --> 18:33.236
That's only due to
your own shortcomings.

18:33.237 --> 18:38.659
Prince Lloyd, I'm afraid this sword is
slightly lacking in durability! It's cracked!

18:39.284 --> 18:41.202
Yes, yes. I see.

18:41.203 --> 18:43.788
<i>The two of them are so amazing.</i>

18:43.789 --> 18:46.124
<i>While they fight ghouls, and each other,</i>

18:46.125 --> 18:48.626
<i>they're also giving Lloyd
combat data on his magic.</i>

18:48.627 --> 18:51.671
<i>I want to do something to help him too.</i>

18:51.672 --> 18:53.006
<i>I want that date!</i>

18:54.633 --> 18:55.717
<i>I know!</i>

18:56.176 --> 18:57.594
Lloyd!

18:57.970 --> 18:59.972
Watch this!

19:03.725 --> 19:06.811
She's giving it a poison effect.
Interesting.

19:06.812 --> 19:10.232
That's sacred sorcery from the
gods she's tampering with!

19:10.732 --> 19:12.442
But she's cute, so I'll allow it.

19:13.986 --> 19:17.030
Now that it's poisonous,
too, it's powered up!

19:18.532 --> 19:21.784
Or broken?! And didn't work at all!

19:21.785 --> 19:23.452
It got clouded.

19:23.453 --> 19:25.830
<i>Divine sorcery is delicate...</i>

19:25.831 --> 19:28.417
<i>Tamper with it carelessly and
it's effectiveness plummets.</i>

19:31.044 --> 19:34.506
Actually, you gave me a great idea.

19:36.675 --> 19:38.343
Try this one, Ren!

19:40.470 --> 19:42.848
But it seems the same as before?

19:50.105 --> 19:51.440
(Ren +1
Total Kills: 6)

19:51.857 --> 19:54.483
It fell apart like it was poisoned!

19:54.484 --> 19:56.194
And the weapon is fine!

19:56.195 --> 20:00.406
I tried something that took inspiration
from the effects of poison sorcery.

20:00.407 --> 20:04.368
You could call it a kind of divine
sorcery that does damage over time.

20:04.369 --> 20:05.578
Makes sense!

20:05.579 --> 20:09.790
It's not really poisonous, but divine
sorcery is especially effective on ghouls

20:09.791 --> 20:13.502
Even a scratch results in the purifying
effect spreading, the same way poison does.

20:13.503 --> 20:15.589
Did you know it could work like this?

20:17.507 --> 20:19.384
I guess it makes sense that you wouldn't.

20:19.676 --> 20:25.556
<i>Divine sorcery was concocted
by the gods to fight demons.</i>

20:25.557 --> 20:30.144
<i>And it was effective enough that they
didn't bother refining it beyond that.</i>

20:30.145 --> 20:33.982
<i>But now the brat's got his hands on it...</i>

20:34.399 --> 20:39.153
<i>And divine sorcery is about to evolve
like it's making up for lost time!</i>

20:39.154 --> 20:40.405
<i>Not only that-</i>

20:45.327 --> 20:49.413
<i>But he's got the best assistants
you could ask for!</i>

20:49.414 --> 20:53.417
Prince Lloyd, this sword's weirdly floppy!

20:53.418 --> 20:56.755
I added some water traits to it.
It won't break now.

20:57.130 --> 20:58.923
(Tao Current Total:
23 Kills)

20:58.924 --> 21:02.469
True, but it's really awkward to use!

21:03.387 --> 21:05.430
(Ren Current Total:
23 Kills)

21:08.934 --> 21:10.936
Two left!

21:11.561 --> 21:13.272
They're in a dead heat!

21:13.689 --> 21:16.148
Whoever gets that one takes Lloyd...

21:16.149 --> 21:17.900
Prince Lloyd...

21:17.901 --> 21:19.528
On a date!

21:38.422 --> 21:42.509
Civil War is engaging the intruders
down below as we speak.

21:45.220 --> 21:48.974
It seems I really would be better off
increasing security around here.

21:49.558 --> 21:53.478
So, what do you need me to do?
Take over his body?

21:53.895 --> 21:59.443
Yes. A pastor's body will give you
freedom to move around the church.

22:09.286 --> 22:13.123
What are you... doing?

22:15.292 --> 22:20.005
Oh, another useful pile of flesh.

23:51.638 --> 23:54.098
<i>Singing really works up an appetite.</i>

23:54.099 --> 23:55.976
<i>Granted, I get hungry even
when I'm not singing...</i>

23:56.309 --> 23:59.104
<i>Anyway, it looks like I'm in big trouble!</i>

23:59.604 --> 24:01.438
Next time, on Episode 16:

24:01.439 --> 24:02.773
"Civil War."

24:02.774 --> 24:05.819
You will witness the depths of sorcery.
